	040011 DescSize         =0x11B
	040010 Desc             ="GLobal fueling adjustment table.  Stock is for 36lb injectors @ 2.5 Bar.  Adjust for larger injectors by inputting injector size in lb/hr.  Higher number reduces injector duty cycle (IDC), lower number increase IDC.  To adjust for 3bar regulator, take each value divide by 1.095445."
